WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Open the installer you downloaded

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:07.400
Drag SkyCut into Applications

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.000
After installing, open SkyCut from Applications

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.900
The first time you open SkyCut, macOS blocks it

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.800
Open System Settings

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.700
Choose Privacy & Security

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.000
Find the Security section

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.400
Click Open Anyway

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.100
Click Open Anyway again in the confirmation dialog

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.500
Confirm with Touch ID or your password

